            "review_text": "Khoi N\nWashington DC, District of Columbia5073 contributions\n0\nAwesome seafood\nJan 2019 • Family\nThis place is really famous with the locals. Come here for awesome seafood. From snails, conch, oysters and more. They have TVs and the traditional small seating for groups as well. Food is really fresh and sanitary. Highly recommend this spot if you're craving some quality seafood with an authentic taste\nWritten January 21, 2019",
